  /// When you are creating a read replica from one Amazon Web Services
  /// GovCloud (US) Region to another or from one China Amazon Web Services
  /// Region to another, the URL that contains a Signature Version 4 signed
  /// request for the CreateDBInstanceReadReplica API operation in the source
  /// Amazon Web Services Region that contains the source DB instance. This
  /// setting applies only to Amazon Web Services GovCloud (US) Regions and
  /// China Amazon Web Services Regions. It's ignored in other Amazon Web
  /// Services Regions. This setting applies only when replicating from a
