  /// Services GovCloud (US) Regions and China Amazon Web Services Regions.
  /// You must specify this parameter when you create an encrypted read
  /// replica from another Amazon Web Services Region by using the Amazon RDS
  /// API. Don't specify PreSignedUrl when you are creating an encrypted read
