  /// set by default. After replica creation, you can manage the open mode
  /// manually.
  pub replica_mode: ReplicaMode? = None
  /// Specifies whether to enable a customer-owned IP address (CoIP) for an
  /// RDS on Outposts read replica. A CoIP provides local or external
  /// connectivity to resources in your Outpost subnets through your
  /// on-premises network. For some use cases, a CoIP can provide lower
  /// latency for connections to the read replica from outside of its virtual
